#: includes/class-segurium.php:1637
msgid "External Service Disclosure"
msgstr "Pengungkapan Layanan Luar"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1638
msgid ""
"Segurium protects your site by working together with the Segurium cloud. When"
" you enable it, Segurium exchanges data with our servers so it can detect "
"malware, verify your files, and adapt protection to active threats."
msgstr ""
"Segurium melindungi situs Anda dengan bekerja sama dengan cloud Segurium. "
"Ketika Anda mengaktifkannya, Segurium bertukar data dengan server kami supaya"
" ia dapat mendeteksi malware, memverifikasi berkas Anda, dan menyesuaikan "
"perlindungan terhadap ancaman aktif."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1640
msgid "What is sent:"
msgstr "Yang dikirim:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1642
msgid ""
"File metadata: SHA-256 hash, path relative to your WordPress installation, "
"size, modification time."
msgstr ""
"Metadata berkas: hash SHA-256, jalur relatif terhadap instalasi WordPress "
"Anda, ukuran, waktu perubahan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1643
msgid ""
"File content — only when classification by hash alone is not conclusive, or "
"when generating a clean replacement during cleanup."
msgstr ""
"Konten berkas — hanya ketika klasifikasi lewat hash saja tidak meyakinkan, "
"atau ketika membuat pengganti bersih selama pembersihan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1644
msgid ""
"A randomly-generated installation identifier and basic site info (URL, name, "
"WordPress version) used to associate requests with this install."
msgstr ""
"Pengidentifikasi instalasi acak dan info dasar situs (URL, nama, versi "
"WordPress) yang dipakai untuk mengaitkan permintaan dengan instalasi ini."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1645
msgid ""
"Scan, cleanup, and security-settings events, so the cloud can keep your site "
"protection in sync."
msgstr ""
"Peristiwa pemindaian, pembersihan, dan pengaturan keamanan, supaya cloud "
"dapat menjaga perlindungan situs Anda tetap selaras."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1646
msgid ""
"Firewall events (blocked IPs, attack patterns) used to adapt protection "
"across all Segurium-protected sites."
msgstr ""
"Peristiwa firewall (IP yang diblokir, pola serangan) yang dipakai untuk "
"menyesuaikan perlindungan di seluruh situs yang dilindungi Segurium."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1647
msgid ""
"The email address for security alerts: the WordPress admin email, or the one "
"you enter below, together with your email alerts choice."
msgstr ""
"Alamat e-mail untuk peringatan keamanan: e-mail admin WordPress, atau yang "
"Anda masukkan di bawah, bersama pilihan peringatan e-mail Anda."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1650
msgid "What is NOT sent:"
msgstr "Yang TIDAK dikirim:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1652
msgid "Visitor analytics or personal data of users who visit your site."
msgstr ""
"Analitik pengunjung atau data pribadi pengguna yang mengunjungi situs Anda."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1653
msgid "Database content, posts, comments, or media files."
msgstr "Konten basis data, pos, komentar, atau berkas media."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1654
msgid ""
"Files whose hash is already known to the cloud — only the hash leaves your "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Berkas yang hash-nya sudah dikenal cloud — hanya hash yang meninggalkan "
"server Anda."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1657
msgid "Where it is sent:"
msgstr "Ke mana dikirimnya:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1657
msgid "Segurium servers at cti.segurium.com."
msgstr "Server Segurium di cti.segurium.com."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1658
msgid "Retention:"
msgstr "Masa simpan:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1658
msgid ""
"File samples uploaded for analysis are kept for up to 365 days and then "
"removed by an automated nightly purge. A sample may be removed sooner once it"
" has been reviewed."
msgstr ""
"Sampel berkas yang diunggah untuk analisis disimpan hingga 365 hari lalu "
"dihapus oleh pembersihan otomatis tiap malam. Sebuah sampel dapat dihapus "
"lebih cepat setelah ditinjau."

#. translators: 1: opening link tag for Terms of Service, 2: closing link tag,
#. 3: opening link tag for Privacy Policy, 4: closing link tag
#: includes/class-segurium.php:1664
#, php-format
msgid ""
"By enabling scanning, you agree to the %1$sTerms of Service%2$s and "
"%3$sPrivacy Policy%4$s."
msgstr ""
"Dengan mengaktifkan pemindaian, Anda menyetujui %1$sKetentuan Layanan%2$s dan"
