msgid "Strict origin"
msgstr "Origin ketat"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2769
msgid "Strict origin when cross-origin"
msgstr "Origin ketat saat lintas origin"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2770
msgid "Unsafe URL"
msgstr "URL tidak aman"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2781 includes/class-segurium.php:2785
msgid "Disabled (recommended)"
msgstr "Dinonaktifkan (disarankan)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2782 includes/class-segurium.php:2786
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Diaktifkan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2783 includes/class-segurium.php:2787
msgid "Enabled with block mode"
msgstr "Diaktifkan dengan mode blokir"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2785
msgid ""
"Explicitly turns off the legacy IE/old-Edge XSS filter, which had universal-"
"XSS bugs that could be weaponised. Modern browsers ignore this header; CSP is"
" the actual XSS defence."
msgstr ""
"Secara tegas mematikan penyaring XSS IE/Edge lama, yang punya bug XSS "
"universal yang dapat dipersenjatai. Peramban modern mengabaikan header ini; "
"CSP adalah pertahanan XSS yang sesungguhnya."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2786
msgid ""
"Tells legacy browsers to sanitise reflections. The filter has false positives"
" that silently break valid pages and known UXSS bypasses. Not recommended."
msgstr ""
"Menyuruh peramban lawas membersihkan pantulan. Penyaring itu punya positif "
"palsu yang diam-diam merusak halaman yang sah serta jalan pintas UXSS yang "
"diketahui. Tidak disarankan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2787
msgid ""
"Same filter as above, but blocks the page entirely on suspected reflection. "
"Same bugs, plus a timing side-channel that can leak cross-origin data. Not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Penyaring yang sama seperti di atas, tetapi memblokir seluruh halaman saat "
"pantulan dicurigai. Bug yang sama, ditambah kanal samping waktu yang dapat "
"membocorkan data lintas origin. Tidak disarankan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2789
msgid "HSTS (Strict-Transport-Security)"
msgstr "HSTS (Strict-Transport-Security)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2793
msgid "Enable HSTS"
msgstr "Aktifkan HSTS"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2795
msgid "Forces browsers to use HTTPS. Only sent when SSL is active."
msgstr "Memaksa peramban memakai HTTPS. Hanya dikirim ketika SSL aktif."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2799
msgid "Max-Age (seconds)"
msgstr "Max-Age (detik)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2805
