msgstr "Kirim header Content-Security-Policy"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2888
msgid ""
"CSP restricts where scripts, styles, and other resources may load from, "
"mitigating XSS and injection. CSP is site-specific and can break themes or "
"page builders — start in report-only mode to surface violations before "
"enforcing."
msgstr ""
"CSP membatasi dari mana skrip, gaya, dan sumber daya lain boleh dimuat, "
"sehingga meredam XSS dan injeksi. CSP bersifat khas per situs dan dapat "
"merusak tema atau page builder — mulailah pada mode hanya-laporan untuk "
"memunculkan pelanggaran sebelum menegakkannya."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2894
msgid "Report-only (recommended for first deploy)"
msgstr "Hanya laporan (disarankan untuk penerapan pertama)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2895
msgid "Enforce"
msgstr "Tegakkan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2897
msgid ""
"Report-only sends Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only — the browser logs "
"violations but still loads blocked resources. Enforce sends Content-Security-"
"Policy and blocks them."
msgstr ""
"Hanya-laporan mengirim Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only — peramban "
"mencatat pelanggaran di log tetapi tetap memuat sumber daya yang diblokir. "
"Tegakkan mengirim Content-Security-Policy lalu memblokirnya."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2900
msgid "Policy directives"
msgstr "Direktif kebijakan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2903
msgid ""
"Single line of directives separated by semicolons. The default starter policy"
" permits Gutenberg and most themes; tighten once your reports are clean."
msgstr ""
"Satu baris direktif yang dipisahkan titik koma. Kebijakan awal standar "
"mengizinkan Gutenberg dan sebagian besar tema; perketat setelah laporan Anda "
"bersih."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2904
msgid "CSP reference (MDN)"
msgstr "Rujukan CSP (MDN)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2908
msgid "Report URI (optional)"
msgstr "Report URI (opsional)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2910
msgid ""
"When set, browsers will POST violation reports to this URL. Appended "
"automatically as report-uri unless your directives already contain one."
msgstr ""
"Bila disetel, peramban akan mengirim laporan pelanggaran ke URL ini lewat "
"POST. Ditambahkan otomatis sebagai report-uri kecuali direktif Anda sudah "
"memuatnya."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2914
msgid "Cookie Hardening"
msgstr "Pengerasan Cookie"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2918
msgid "Add SameSite attribute to auth cookies"
msgstr "Tambahkan atribut SameSite ke cookie autentikasi"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2920
msgid ""
"Adds SameSite flag to WordPress session cookies. Protects against CSRF "
"attacks. Mozilla Observatory penalizes missing SameSite."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan penanda SameSite ke cookie sesi WordPress. Melindungi dari "
"serangan CSRF. Mozilla Observatory menghukum SameSite yang hilang."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2924
msgid "SameSite value"
msgstr "Nilai SameSite"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2926
msgid "Lax (recommended)"
msgstr "Lax (disarankan)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2929
msgid "Strict may break OAuth/SSO login flows that redirect back to your site."
msgstr ""
"Strict dapat merusak alur login OAuth/SSO yang mengalihkan kembali ke situs "
"Anda."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2940
msgid "Headers Preview"
msgstr "Pratinjau Header"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2952
msgid "Enable Information Shield"
msgstr "Aktifkan Information Shield"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2954
msgid ""
"Reduces WordPress information disclosure by removing version fingerprints, "
"discovery endpoints, and unnecessary metadata from HTTP headers and HTML "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Mengurangi pengungkapan informasi WordPress dengan menghapus sidik jari "
"versi, titik akhir penemuan, dan metadata yang tidak perlu dari header HTTP "
"dan keluaran HTML."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2957
msgid "Enable All Recommended"
msgstr "Aktifkan Semua yang Disarankan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2961
msgid "HTTP Header Disclosure"
msgstr "Pengungkapan Header HTTP"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2965
msgid "Remove X-Powered-By header"
msgstr "Hapus header X-Powered-By"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2967
msgid "Removes the header that reveals your PHP version."
msgstr "Menghapus header yang mengungkap versi PHP Anda."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2973
msgid "Remove Server header"
msgstr "Hapus header Server"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2975
msgid ""
"Removes the header that identifies your web server software. Best-effort."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus header yang mengenali perangkat lunak server web Anda. Sebisa "
"mungkin."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2981
msgid "Remove X-Pingback header"
msgstr "Hapus header X-Pingback"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2983
msgid "Hides the pingback/XML-RPC endpoint URL from response headers."
msgstr "Menyembunyikan URL titik akhir pingback/XML-RPC dari header respons."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2988
msgid "Remove REST API Link: header"
msgstr "Hapus header Link: REST API"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2990
msgid "Removes the HTTP Link header that advertises the REST API endpoint."
msgstr "Menghapus header HTTP Link yang mengiklankan titik akhir REST API."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2995
msgid "Remove Shortlink Link: header"
msgstr "Hapus header Link: Shortlink"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2997
msgid "Removes the rel=shortlink HTTP header."
msgstr "Menghapus header HTTP rel=shortlink."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3000
msgid "HTML Meta and Links"
msgstr "Meta dan Tautan HTML"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3004
msgid "Remove WordPress generator tag"
msgstr "Hapus tag generator WordPress"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3006
msgid ""
"Removes the meta generator tag and RSS generator that reveal your WordPress "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus tag meta generator dan generator RSS yang mengungkap versi "
"WordPress Anda."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3011
msgid "Remove RSD link"
msgstr "Hapus tautan RSD"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3013
msgid "Removes the Really Simple Discovery endpoint link from HTML head."
msgstr "Menghapus tautan titik akhir Really Simple Discovery dari head HTML."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3018
msgid "Remove WLW manifest link"
msgstr "Hapus tautan manifes WLW"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3020
msgid ""
"Removes the Windows Live Writer manifest link. Only needed if you use WLW to "
"write posts."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus tautan manifes Windows Live Writer. Hanya perlu bila Anda memakai "
"WLW untuk menulis pos."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3025
msgid "Remove REST API discovery link"
msgstr "Hapus tautan penemuan REST API"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3027
msgid ""
"Removes the discovery link tag from HTML head. The REST API itself remains "
"functional at /wp-json/."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus tag tautan penemuan dari head HTML. REST API itu sendiri tetap "
"berfungsi di /wp-json/."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3032
msgid "Remove oEmbed discovery links"
msgstr "Hapus tautan penemuan oEmbed"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3034
msgid ""
"Prevents other sites from showing rich embed previews when linking to your "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Mencegah situs lain menampilkan pratinjau sematan kaya ketika menautkan ke "
"konten Anda."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3039
msgid "Remove shortlink meta tag"
msgstr "Hapus tag meta shortlink"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3041
msgid "Removes the shortlink link tag from HTML head."
msgstr "Menghapus tag tautan shortlink dari head HTML."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3046
msgid "Remove emoji scripts and styles"
msgstr "Hapus skrip dan gaya emoji"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3048
msgid ""
"Removes the WordPress emoji polyfill JavaScript and CSS. Modern browsers have"
" native emoji support."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus JavaScript dan CSS polyfill emoji WordPress. Peramban modern sudah "
"mendukung emoji secara bawaan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3053
msgid "Remove RSS/Atom feed links"
msgstr "Hapus tautan umpan RSS/Atom"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3055
msgid ""
"May break RSS readers and WordPress.com Reader. Only enable if your site does"
" not use RSS feeds."
msgstr ""
"Dapat merusak pembaca RSS dan WordPress.com Reader. Aktifkan hanya bila situs"
" Anda tidak memakai umpan RSS."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3060
msgid "Remove adjacent post links"
msgstr "Hapus tautan pos bersebelahan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3062
msgid "Removes prev/next post rel links from HTML head."
msgstr "Menghapus tautan rel pos sebelumnya/berikutnya dari head HTML."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3065
msgid "Asset Fingerprinting"
msgstr "Sidik Jari Aset"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3069
msgid "Remove version query strings"
msgstr "Hapus string kueri versi"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3071
msgid ""
"Strips ?ver= from CSS and JavaScript URLs. Browser-cached assets may become "
"stale after plugin or theme updates."
msgstr ""
"Melucuti ?ver= dari URL CSS dan JavaScript. Aset yang tersimpan di cache "
"peramban dapat menjadi basi setelah plugin atau tema diperbarui."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3078
msgid "Disable XML-RPC entirely"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan XML-RPC sepenuhnya"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3080
msgid ""
"Some plugins (Jetpack, WordPress mobile app) require XML-RPC. Disable only if"
" you do not use them."
msgstr ""
"Sebagian plugin (Jetpack, aplikasi seluler WordPress) memerlukan XML-RPC. "
"Nonaktifkan hanya bila Anda tidak memakainya."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3092
msgid "Security Self-Check"
msgstr "Security Self-Check"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3094
msgid ""
"Segurium runs the same checks as leading external security scanners, plus "
"WordPress-specific hardening checks, and grades your site A+ to F. Results "
"are saved until the next run."
msgstr ""
"Segurium menjalankan pemeriksaan yang sama seperti pemindai keamanan luar "
"terkemuka, ditambah pemeriksaan pengerasan khas WordPress, lalu menilai situs"
" Anda dari A+ sampai F. Hasilnya disimpan sampai jalan berikutnya."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3113
msgid "Check results"
msgstr "Hasil pemeriksaan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3115
msgid "Independent verification"
msgstr "Verifikasi independen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3117
msgid "Cross-check results with these public scanners:"
msgstr "Periksa silang hasilnya dengan pemindai publik ini:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3120
msgid "securityheaders.com"
msgstr "securityheaders.com"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3121
msgid "Mozilla Observatory"
msgstr "Mozilla Observatory"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3135
msgid "Cleanup: 3 files / 30 days"
msgstr "Pembersihan: 3 berkas / 30 hari"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3136
msgid "Full malware detection — same findings as Pro"
msgstr "Deteksi malware penuh — temuan sama seperti Pro"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3137
msgid "Auto-fix and Bulk Fix All"
msgstr "Perbaikan otomatis dan Perbaiki Semua massal"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3138
msgid "Hardening: 2FA, brute-force, geo-blocking, firewall, security headers"
msgstr ""
"Pengerasan: 2FA, brute force, pemblokiran geografis, firewall, header "
"keamanan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3139
msgid "File-integrity monitoring (core / plugins / themes)"
msgstr "Pemantauan integritas berkas (core / plugin / tema)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3140
msgid "Migration importer (Wordfence, AIOS, Solid Security)"
msgstr "Pengimpor migrasi (Wordfence, AIOS, Solid Security)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3141
msgid "Community support"
msgstr "Bantuan komunitas"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3144
msgid "Unlimited cleanup"
msgstr "Pembersihan tanpa batas"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3145
msgid "Everything in Free"
msgstr "Semua yang ada di Free"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3146
msgid "Email support, priority queue"
msgstr "Bantuan e-mail, antrean prioritas"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3154
msgid ""
"Every feature ships on every install. Pro lifts the monthly cleanup cap."
msgstr ""
"Tiap fitur dikirim pada tiap instalasi. Pro menaikkan batas pembersihan "
"bulanan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3161 includes/class-segurium.php:3186
msgid "Current plan"
msgstr "Paket saat ini"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3164 includes/class-segurium.php:3434
msgid "Free"
msgstr "Free"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3166
msgid "Every feature, on every site. Cleanups capped at 3 per 30 days."
msgstr "Tiap fitur, di tiap situs. Pembersihan dibatasi 3 tiap 30 hari."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3171
msgid "forever"
msgstr "selamanya"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3195
msgid "Unlimited cleanup. Same features as Free, with no monthly cap."
msgstr "Pembersihan tanpa batas. Fitur sama seperti Free, tanpa batas bulanan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3200
msgid "/year per site"
msgstr "/tahun per situs"

#. translators: 1: opening anchor tag, 2: closing anchor tag
#: includes/class-segurium.php:3224
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Bundles for 5 and 25 sites, plus 100+ quotes, on "
"%1$ssegurium.com/pricing/%2$s."
msgstr ""
"Bundel untuk 5 dan 25 situs, plus penawaran 100+, ada di "
"%1$ssegurium.com/pricing/%2$s."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3242
msgid "Scan Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Pemindaian"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3245
msgid ""
"Exclude files from scan that match these wildcard patterns (one per line)"
msgstr ""
"Kecualikan berkas dari pemindaian yang cocok dengan pola wildcard ini (satu "
"per baris)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3247
msgid ""
"Use * as a wildcard. For example, *.log will exclude all log files. vendor/* "
"will exclude the vendor directory and everything inside it."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan * sebagai wildcard. Misalnya, *.log akan mengecualikan semua berkas "
"log. vendor/* akan mengecualikan direktori vendor dan semua isinya."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3255
msgid ""
"When enabled, file contents may be shared with Segurium Cloud for advanced "
"malware detection and cloud-powered cleanup. Only suspicious files are "
"transmitted. Turn it off for On-premise mode: scans then send SHA-256 hashes,"
" file paths, and metadata only, and a file the cloud cannot identify by hash "
"stays unresolved. Reporting a false positive or attaching a file to a support"
" ticket still sends that file, because you pick it yourself."
msgstr ""
"Ketika diaktifkan, konten berkas dapat dibagikan dengan Segurium Cloud untuk "
"deteksi malware lanjutan dan pembersihan bertenaga cloud. Hanya berkas "
"mencurigakan yang dikirim. Matikan untuk mode On-premise: pemindaian lalu "
"hanya mengirim hash SHA-256, jalur berkas, dan metadata, dan berkas yang "
"tidak dapat dikenali cloud lewat hash tetap menggantung. Melaporkan positif "
"palsu atau melampirkan berkas ke tiket bantuan tetap mengirim berkas itu, "
"karena Anda sendiri yang memilihnya."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3261
msgid "Email me about findings"
msgstr "Kirimi saya e-mail tentang temuan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3263
msgid ""
"Send a daily digest of malware verdicts and successful cleanups, delivered "
"from support@segurium.com. At most one email per site per 24 hours."
msgstr ""
"Mengirim ringkasan harian berisi putusan malware dan pembersihan yang "
"berhasil, dikirim dari support@segurium.com. Paling banyak satu e-mail per "
"situs tiap 24 jam."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3277
msgid "Wipe encrypted backups when the plugin is uninstalled"
msgstr "Musnahkan cadangan terenkripsi ketika plugin diuninstal"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3279
msgid ""
"Off (default): encrypted backups of deleted components and cured files are "
"kept in the uploads/segurium-data directory after uninstall, so a reinstall "
"can still restore them. Turn on only if you want a hard deletion on "
"uninstall."
msgstr ""
"Mati (standar): cadangan terenkripsi berisi komponen yang dihapus dan berkas "
"yang disembuhkan tetap disimpan di direktori uploads/segurium-data setelah "
"uninstal, sehingga pemasangan ulang masih dapat memulihkannya. Nyalakan hanya"
" bila Anda menginginkan penghapusan permanen saat uninstal."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3289
msgid "Automatically clean detected malware"
msgstr "Bersihkan malware yang terdeteksi secara otomatis"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3291
msgid ""
"After every scheduled or real-time scan, files with a known malware or "
"injection verdict are cleaned without requiring a click. Files you have "
"ignored (by path or by hash) are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Setelah tiap pemindaian terjadwal atau real-time, berkas dengan putusan "
"malware atau injeksi yang diketahui dibersihkan tanpa perlu klik. Berkas yang"
" Anda abaikan (per jalur atau per hash) dilewati."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3297
msgid "Let Segurium Cloud request component updates"
msgstr "Izinkan Segurium Cloud meminta pembaruan komponen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3299
msgid ""
"Segurium Cloud can ask this site to update a plugin, theme, or WordPress "
"itself. It can only name a component you already have installed, and only "
"when WordPress.org already offers that update; the update is downloaded by "
"WordPress from WordPress.org, never from Segurium. WordPress core is limited "
"to security and maintenance releases. Segurium never updates itself this way."
" Turn this off and the site stops asking for and accepting these requests."
msgstr ""
"Segurium Cloud dapat meminta situs ini memperbarui plugin, tema, atau "
"WordPress itu sendiri. Ia hanya dapat menyebut komponen yang sudah Anda "
"pasang, dan hanya ketika WordPress.org sudah menawarkan pembaruan itu; "
"pembaruan diunduh oleh WordPress dari WordPress.org, tidak pernah dari "
"Segurium. Core WordPress dibatasi pada rilis keamanan dan pemeliharaan. "
"Segurium tidak pernah memperbarui dirinya sendiri lewat cara ini. Matikan ini"
" dan situs berhenti meminta serta menerima permintaan tersebut."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3301
msgid "Switched off in wp-config.php by SEGURIUM_DISABLE_REMOTE_ACTIONS."
msgstr "Dimatikan di wp-config.php oleh SEGURIUM_DISABLE_REMOTE_ACTIONS."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3305
msgid "Recent cloud requests"
msgstr "Permintaan cloud terbaru"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3311
msgid "Outcome"
msgstr "Hasil"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3343
msgid "Scheduled Scan"
msgstr "Pemindaian Terjadwal"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3345
msgid ""
"Run a full malware scan automatically on a recurring schedule. A scheduled "
"scan does the same work as a manual scan, but does not require you to keep "
"your browser open. A scheduled tick that fires while a manual scan is already"
" in progress is skipped, not queued."
msgstr ""
"Menjalankan pemindaian malware penuh secara otomatis pada jadwal berulang. "
"Pemindaian terjadwal mengerjakan hal yang sama seperti pemindaian manual, "
"tetapi tidak menuntut Anda membiarkan peramban terbuka. Detak terjadwal yang "
"jatuh ketika pemindaian manual sedang berjalan akan dilewati, bukan "
"diantrekan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3372
msgid "Save Schedule"
msgstr "Simpan Jadwal"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3380
msgid ""
"Import settings from other security plugins into Segurium. Existing Segurium "
"settings are preserved; imported data is merged."
msgstr ""
"Impor pengaturan dari plugin keamanan lain ke Segurium. Pengaturan Segurium "
"yang ada tetap dipertahankan; data yang diimpor digabungkan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3431
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versi"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3433
msgid "Plan"
msgstr "Paket"

#. translators: brand name of the service, do not translate
#: includes/class-segurium.php:3436
msgid "Segurium Cloud"
msgstr "Segurium Cloud"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3438
msgid "Geo DB updated"
msgstr "Basis data geo diperbarui"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3445
msgid "Proxies DB updated"
msgstr "Basis data proksi diperbarui"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3455
msgid "IID"
msgstr "IID"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3461
msgid "Copy IID to clipboard"
msgstr "Salin IID ke papan klip"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3465
msgid "Your IP"
msgstr "IP Anda"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3559
msgid "A bare * pattern was removed because it would exclude all files."
msgstr "Pola * tunggal dihapus karena akan mengecualikan semua berkas."

#. translators: %d: number of rewritten lines
#: includes/class-segurium.php:3576
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d absolute path was rewritten to a path relative to the WordPress install "
"root."
msgid_plural ""
"%d absolute paths were rewritten to paths relative to the WordPress install "
"root."
msgstr[0] ""
"%d jalur absolut ditulis ulang menjadi jalur relatif terhadap root instalasi "
"WordPress."
msgstr[1] ""
"%d jalur absolut ditulis ulang menjadi jalur relatif terhadap root instalasi "
"WordPress."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3589
msgid "Scan exclusion list is limited to 500 entries."
msgstr "Daftar pengecualian pemindaian dibatasi 500 entri."

#. translators: %d: number of rejected lines
#: includes/class-segurium.php:3596
#, php-format
msgid "%d entry longer than 191 characters was removed."
msgid_plural "%d entries longer than 191 characters were removed."
msgstr[0] "%d entri yang lebih panjang dari 191 karakter dihapus."
msgstr[1] "%d entri yang lebih panjang dari 191 karakter dihapus."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3645 includes/class-segurium.php:3678
msgid "You do not have permission to manage scan settings."
msgstr "Anda tidak punya izin untuk mengelola pengaturan pemindaian."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3757
msgid "The scan could not be started due to a server error."
msgstr "Pemindaian tidak dapat dimulai karena eror server."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3846
msgid "Could not stop the running scan due to a server error."
msgstr "Tidak dapat menghentikan pemindaian yang berjalan karena eror server."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3894
msgid "Check the PHP error log for details."
msgstr "Periksa log eror PHP untuk detailnya."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:4025
msgid "No scan results available"
msgstr "Tidak ada hasil pemindaian yang tersedia"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:4096 includes/class-segurium.php:6058
#: includes/class-segurium.php:6062 includes/class-segurium.php:6118
